id: SCA-039
title: Python base64 decode combined with exec
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: setup.py
  extensions: .py
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: base64\.(b64decode|decodebytes).*\b(exec|eval|compile|os\.system|subprocess)\b
    message: Base64-encoded payload decoded and executed — signature pattern of TeamPCP/Shai-Hulud supply chain attacks.
fix: Remove any base64-decode-to-exec pattern. This is a near-certain indicator of malicious code. Report the package.
